    "detailed_description": "<h1>Current Status &amp; Future Plans</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Current:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few \u201cworkmates\u201d have joined. <span class=\"bb_strike\">You\u2019re no longer alone. When you\u2019re stressed, chat with them; when you\u2019re overwhelmed, call them in.</span> (Cut a part,personality-driven dialogue system. In the factory, everyone minds their own business\u2014few are truly helpful.)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Finishing tasks is part of the design, but how you do them depends on your choices in the scene.</span> (Work is routine, but people are the core. The experience focuses on what kind of tasks exist, not rigid schedules or repetitive actions.)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Dialogue-triggered changes in workmates .</span> (Were removed.See point 1. Workmates repeat their own loops, and designing meaningful changes proved unproductive.)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Future:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">More work mechanisms and \u201cworkmate feedback\u201d will be added.</span> (Done, their insights are always unique across different tasks\u2014go discover them!)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">More dialogue topics to simulate real-life small talk.</span> (Cut,work is busy, conversations stay task-focused. Also, privacy matters, doesn\u2019t it?)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New contact features and walkie-talkie system. (Not yet completed.)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Simulating real-world work dynamics: in reality, work gets done even when people aren\u2019t present. And if you finish extra tasks but don\u2019t report them\u2026</span> (Photo-upload system is in its early stages. Stay tuned for updates when it\u2019s fully integrated.)</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chemical Worker Simulator \u2014 A pioneering, unconventional simulation experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Work your shift, no pressure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Talk to coworkers, learn their quirks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2022 Tedious tasks, emotional release</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Promotions and raises? Not likely</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Ordinary stories, lived in daily life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you're a student curious about the chemical industry and want a taste of real workplace routines, this is the perfect place to start</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you've worked\u2014or still work\u2014in the field and want to revisit the laughter and tears of the job, you\u2019ll feel right at home;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you prefer to decide what to do and how to play, without being led by systems, this was made for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Here, you get a job and a group of coworkers. In every ordinary day, there's a story worth telling.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chemical Worker Simulator \u2014 A pioneering, unconventional simulation experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Work your shift, no pressure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Talk to coworkers, learn their quirks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2022 Tedious tasks, emotional release</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Promotions and raises? Not likely</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Ordinary stories, lived in daily life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you're a student curious about the chemical industry and want a taste of real workplace routines, this is the perfect place to start</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you've worked\u2014or still work\u2014in the field and want to revisit the laughter and tears of the job, you\u2019ll feel right at home;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you prefer to decide what to do and how to play, without being led by systems, this was made for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Here, you get a job and a group of coworkers. In every ordinary day, there's a story worth telling.</i></p>",
